>**Raises nation's Funds and Morale at the cost of {p:Supplies|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Supplies}.**
=2 Walkthrough
* Receive the mission from {n:Hieronymus}.
* Join a {p:Campaign Battle|Category:Campaign Battle} in a {p:Quadav Shieldwarriors|Category:Quadav Shieldwarriors} controlled area.
* After completing the Objective, report back to {n:Hieronymus} to complete the mission.

=2 Notes
* To complete this mission you MUST participate in a Campaign battle in a Beastmen controlled zone.
* You need an even 3000 EXP to complete this Campaign Op. Can be done over mulitple campaign battles in different areas.
* You will receive your mission reward along with the Campaign battle assessment immediately after your objective has been completed.

=2 Objective
\**Unit Requirement:** 1 member
